问题很容易。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">党</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">政党；党派；爱好者；迷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101790\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>党<rp>(</rp><rt>とう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>代表<rp>(</rp><rt>だいひょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是党的代表。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塔</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">塔；尖塔；塔楼；佛塔；宝塔；舍利塔</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187146\"><ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からその<ruby>塔<rp>(</rp><rt>とう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">从我家可以看到那座塔。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/3667876\" title=\"Tatoeba · inkarl\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · inkarl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">答案</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とうあん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">试卷；答题纸；答卷；答案；解答</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150609\"><ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。<ruby>答案<rp>(</rp><rt>とうあん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">是时候了,请给我答案。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">当時</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とうじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">当时；那时候；那些日子</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207465\">その<ruby>当時<rp>(</rp><rt>とうじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>回想<rp>(</rp><rt>かいそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すれば<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のようだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">想起那一刻,就好像是梦想。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">到着</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とうちゃく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">到达；抵达</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206173\">その<ruby>列車<rp>(</rp><rt>れっしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>予定<rp>(</rp><rt>よてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>どおりに<ruby>到着<rp>(</rp><rt>とうちゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">火车按照计划到达。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">投票</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とうひょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">投票；表决；选票</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110581\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はもう<ruby>成人<rp>(</rp><rt>せいじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なので<ruby>投票<rp>(</rp><rt>とうひょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他已经成年了,所以可以投票。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">让通过；放行；让路；透（光、声音等）；导（电）；使渗透；通（风）；贯穿；透进；穿过（孔洞）；硬塞过去；穿（针）；插过；连接（两地）；开通（道路等）；建立联系；接通；延伸到；让（考生、申请者等）通过；录取；准许进入；把人领进（屋内、房间等）；引进；带入；让进；有条理地陈述；使论点站得住；（说理）前后一贯；坚持（原则）；经由（中间人）；以…为中介；借助（某物）进行；使（法案）通过；使（议案）获通过；为……让路；隔着（门、墙等）听；透过（窗户等）看；（烹饪）彻底加热；煮熟；热透；均匀受热；（烹饪）浸入（调味汁）；过一下（汤汁）；放入沸水中焯；使（他人）认可（计划等）；迫使同意；强行推进；坚持己见；继续保持；持续进行；一直做；保持某种状态；透过…来看；从…的角度来做；对整体进行；覆盖全部；贯穿整个；从头到尾不间断地做；一次做完；一口气做；一次性完成；转达；传达；传递信息；让声音传出；（接动词连用形）做到底；坚持做下去；贯彻；做完</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97850\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>訪問者<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうもんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>居間<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把客人带到房间里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">街道；道路；大街；交通；往来；流动；通行；流通；声音传播；声音范围；声誉；好评；人气；理解；领会；清晰度；同样的方式；如同；按照；套；组（用于计数）；种；类；方法（用于计数）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222897\">この<ruby>煙突<rp>(</rp><rt>えんとつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りが<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个烟雾,街道变得更糟。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通り過ぎる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおりすぎる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">经过；通过；走过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160303\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>暗<rp>(</rp><rt>くら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>道<rp>(</rp><rt>みち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我走过了那个黑暗的道路。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">都会</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">都市；城市；东京都议会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230690\">あの<ruby>人達<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとたち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>都会<rp>(</rp><rt>とかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>生活<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあこがれている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们在城市生活中沉浸着。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">時</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">时间；时刻；时候；场合；情况；机会；时机；季节；时代；时局；年代；时态</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79711\"><ruby>夜<rp>(</rp><rt>よる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はたいていの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">夜晚是大多数人睡觉的时候。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">解く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">解开；松开；打开；拆开；解绑；拆包；拆线；拆缝；解答；求解；回答；消除（误会等）；澄清；解除（怀疑）；安抚；解除（合同）；取消；撤销（禁令）；解除（禁令）；解围；免除（职务）；解除；免职；梳理；梳通；解开（缠结的头发）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"104339\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>重責<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>解<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他被重责解除。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">得意</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とくい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">满足；自豪；得意；欣喜；专长；特长；擅长的领域；老顾客；常客；主顾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231810\">あなたは<ruby>数学<rp>(</rp><rt>すうがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>得意<rp>(</rp><rt>とくい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你有数学能力吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">特徴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とくちょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">特征；特点；特色；特质</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214813\">スクラムはラグビーの<ruby>特徴<rp>(</rp><rt>とくちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">斯克拉姆是拉格比的特点。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">解ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">得到解决；被解开；松开；解开；散开；被解除；被解禁；被消除（咒语、诅咒等）；消散；烟消云散；缓解；平复；得到化解；得到澄清</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"98792\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もその<ruby>数学<rp>(</rp><rt>すうがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>解<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他和我解决了这个数学问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ところが</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">然而；可是；不过；反而；其实</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200872\">ところが<ruby>実<rp>(</rp><rt>じつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどうすることもできないのです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">但事实上,我们不能做什么。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ところで</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">顺便说一下；话说回来；那么；好了；即使；无论（如何、何处、怎样等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200850\">ところで、<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどうしたのですか。</span><span class=\"e